     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ahip-demo-temporary-codes</b></p><a name=\"ahip-demo-temporary-codes\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-demo-temporary-codes\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Language: en</p></div><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-temporary-codes</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9999-1<a name=\"ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-1\"> </a></td><td>Athabascan</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9999-2<a name=\"ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-2\"> </a></td><td>Haudenosaunee</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9999-4<a name=\"ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-4\"> </a></td><td>Muscogee (Eastern, Lower, Star Clan)</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9999-5<a name=\"ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-5\"> </a></td><td>Angolan</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9999-6<a name=\"ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-6\"> </a></td><td>Cabo Verdean</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9999-7<a name=\"ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-7\"> </a></td><td>Congolese</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9999-8<a name=\"ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-8\"> </a></td><td>Ghanaian</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9999-9<a name=\"ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-9\"> </a></td><td>Kenyan</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9999-10<a name=\"ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-10\"> </a></td><td>Sudanese</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9999-12<a name=\"ahip-demo-tempor